# Absolute base URL of the API, e.g. https://hrms.example.com/api
#
# Leave this UNSET for local development: Vite proxies /api to the API on :3000
# (see vite.config.ts), so the app talks to it same-origin. Docker Compose is
# the same story — nginx proxies /api to the API container (see nginx.conf).
#
# Set it only when the frontend is served from a different origin than the API.
# Vite inlines the value at BUILD time, so changing it requires a rebuild — and
# the API's WEB_ORIGIN must name this site's origin or CORS will block every
# request.
# VITE_API_URL=
